<http://data.silknow.org/object/93c0306b-052f-3305-b7fe-6917297b531c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Bag made of tapestry woven silver-gilt filé and silk thread in red and shades of pink, green and blue, lined with blue silk taffeta.  The woven design includes flowers, trees and landscapes with a cupid, a house and a seated horse.  It is made of 4 shield-shaped panels with couched silver-gilt filé over the seams. The drawstrings are made of braided green silk with 4 elaborate tassels covered with copper-gilt filé, strip and wire."@en , "Bag, 1630-50, French; tapestry woven with silver-gilt and silk thread, drawstring and tassels"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/3edb8ea9-aff6-3d0c-b06b-2d128abbbdd3> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e1078d36-6fff-3043-8ca1-a3b554ce0ee0> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5b9805b5-7125-39e9-8ce4-fe4405cb0d79> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Bag, 1630-50, French; tapestry woven with silver-gilt and silk thread, drawstring and tassels"@en , "Bag made of tapestry woven silver-gilt filé and silk thread in red and shades of pink, green and blue, lined with blue silk taffeta.  The woven design includes flowers, trees and landscapes with a cupid, a house and a seated horse.  It is made of 4 shield-shaped panels with couched silver-gilt filé over the seams. The drawstrings are made of braided green silk with 4 elaborate tassels covered with copper-gilt filé, strip and wire."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/93c0306b-052f-3305-b7fe-6917297b531c/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/93c0306b-052f-3305-b7fe-6917297b531c/dimension/2> ;
